lemma expensesTac {ξq ωt ωv:ℝ} (hu:Jams.sphere ξq ωv ωt) (Θ₁:Luna.Tableau ξq 300) (PB:ℕ→ℕ): ∃ f : ℕ → ℕ, v₀ ≤ f ∧ ∀ L :ℕ→ℕ,f ≤ L → Nonempty (Rolls (ThroughLaunch.raise s L)) ∧
